# The admin password (and its hash) are swapped for placeholders when files are committed, and put back on checkout,
# by the "secrets" filter. Its commands - with the real values - live only in .git/config, never in the repository.
# On a fresh clone without that filter the files simply keep the placeholders. See SECRETS.md.
*.php  filter=secrets
*.html filter=secrets
*.js   filter=secrets
*.sql  filter=secrets
*.md   filter=secrets
*.txt  filter=secrets
*.json filter=secrets
